  "surveyNotes": "Current active2023 BAG parent includes historic1887 circus hall/front and 1992/93 modern stagehouse. Native facade+X axis162.988deg, front+Z252.988deg toward Amstel. Current AHN5 LoD2.2 main dome20–29m, sign roof31.1–32.61m, rear stagehouse21.5m lower hall /22.55m seven-bay blocks /28.6m intermediate cladding. These stepped roofs supersede the older kit whole-block19+8m dome. Do not replace adjacent separate north/south houses or Onbekendegracht. Fine ornament heights and smooth roof curvature are original visual approximations within measured envelope."
